 ('Profile',[('Ana','What was he known for?','Pelo que ele era conhecido?'),('Leo','For distinguishing real outbreaks from noise.','Por distinguir surtos reais de ruído.'),('Ana','How did he work with patchy data?','Como trabalhava com dados incompletos?'),('Leo','He deduced patterns others missed.','Deduzia padrões que outros não viam.')]),
 [('Use distinguish from.','Use.','He can distinguish truth from lies.'),('Use deduce.','Use.','I deduce that she left early.'),('Use credit with.','Use.','They credit him with the discovery.')],
