 ('Interview prep',[('Ana','What if funding stopped?','E se o financiamento parasse?'),('Leo','Were funding to stop, we would lose forty years of data.','Se o financiamento parasse, perderíamos quarenta anos de dados.'),('Ana','What would you change?','O que mudaria?'),('Leo','Were I to start again, I would involve communities earlier.','Se eu recomeçasse, envolveria as comunidades mais cedo.')]),
 [('Use were funding to.','Use.','Were funding to end, we’d stop.'),('Use were I in charge.','Use.','Were I in charge, I’d invest more.'),('Use were it not for.','Use.','Were it not for you, I’d fail.')],
