 ('Reading · A call for proposals',ad('Call for Proposals: Early-Career Grants',['**If** your project **addresses** a gap in the literature, **apply** by 15 March. **Unless** you **submit** an ethics statement, your file **will not be** reviewed. **Provided that** your budget **is** realistic, we **will fund** up to €20,000.','**Were** your proposal **to be** shortlisted, you **would be invited** to present. **Had** you **applied** last year, you **would have received** feedback by now. **Should** you have questions, e-mail our office.'],gloss=[('shortlist','selecionar para a lista final'),('gap','lacuna'),('ethics statement','declaração de ética'),('feedback','retorno')])),
 [('Applicants must submit an ethics statement.','T','Unless you submit.'),('The maximum funding is €2,000.','F','€20,000.'),('Shortlisted applicants would present their proposals.','T','invited to present.')],
 [('“shortlist” = ?',['selecionar para lista final','lista curta','lista de compras'],0,'shortlisted.'),('“address” (a gap) = ?',['abordar','endereço','adicionar'],0,'addresses a gap.')],
 G('Condicionais: quadro geral',['Tipo','Estrutura','Exemplo'],[['zero','If + presente, presente','**If a file is incomplete, it is rejected.**'],['1º','If + presente, will + base','**If you apply, we will review it.**'],['2º / were … to','If + passado, would + base','**Were it shortlisted, you would be invited.**'],['3º / misto','If + past perfect, would (have)','**Had you applied, you would have feedback now.**']],'Escolha o tipo pelo **grau de realidade**: certo (zero), provável (1º), improvável (2º), impossível (3º).'),
 [('___ you submit an ethics statement, your file will not be reviewed. (Unless)','Unless','unless.',None),('___ that your budget is realistic, we will fund it. (Provided)','Provided','provided that.',None),('Were it shortlisted, you ___ be invited. (would)','would','2º condicional.',None),('___ you applied last year, you would have feedback now. (Had)','Had','misto invertido.',None)],
